		(property "Design_note" "Connector-local ground-referenced transient suppression. Sustained faults rely on the downstream current/voltage disconnects. Not a sustained miswire clamp. Verified TI land/paste pattern; common mask artwork and interpad copper exclusion for DQA A/B-compatible assembly. No via-in-pad. Spare protection channel(s) IO pin 5 left unconnected (a spare TVS channel may float; the connector GND pin needs no clamp to GND)."
