		(property "Design_note" "Effective capacitance and rated voltage are assembly requirements; place close to supported pins. The fitted voltage rating meets or exceeds the required minimum. Effective capacitance under bias, temperature and aging remains a separate acceptance requirement. Private SAFE_3V3 feeds the protected-side I2C buffer/pullups; exposed EXP_3V3 cannot directly drive these protected nodes. VREF partial-power behaviour (one supply off) is not yet characterised."
