	(gr_text "1. Material: FR-4 Tg150, 6 layers (Shengyi S1000H/S1000HB or the fab's standard Tg150 equivalent). Report any stack change.\n2. Thickness: standard 1.6 mm 6-layer build, standard tolerance (the note-4 stack-up models 1.52 mm incl. mask).\n3. Copper: 1 oz (35 um) finished on ALL layers, inner layers included. Inner power routing is sized for 1 oz.\n   No impedance control. L2 and L5 are identical solid GND planes (intentional).\n4. Stack-up (top to bottom):"
		(at 160 43 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "28fb92eb-3a84-4a3b-9fce-af0d7a42528e")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "5. Vias: through only, TENTED BOTH SIDES (not plugged, filled or capped), no via-in-pad. 0.6/0.3 mm x611.\n   Plated holes: 1.0 mm x58, 1.02 mm x4, 1.04 mm x40. NPTH: 2.1 mm x4, 2.3 mm x2, 2.7 mm x6. Min finished hole 0.30 mm.\n6. Min track / space 0.15 / 0.15 mm; via annular ring 0.15 mm; copper to board edge >= 0.5 mm; hole to hole >= 0.45 mm.\n7. Finish ENIG. Solder mask black, legend white, both sides. Min mask web 0.10 mm; ganged mask windows on fine-pitch\n   parts are intentional (no dams). Legend over tented via drills (outlines at Q1, U13, J1) may be clipped.\n8. Panel: 5 mm process rails. NO mouse-bite tabs on the marked edges: SW1-SW4 flanks (X 63.0 and X 143.0, Y -145 to -182),\n   RGB1/RGB2 front arc (X 70 to 136, Y -40 to -47) and east edge (X 151.0, Y -105 to -130); Gerber coordinates.\n   Sand tab residue flush. Send the panel drawing for approval.\n9. Stencil 0.10-0.11 mm, both sides (0.5 mm pitch ESD arrays, 0201 C5); apertures exactly as in the paste Gerbers.\n10. Assembly: double-sided SMT, bottom side first. PI1 and J1 through-hole: hand-solder after reflow (no wave).\n11. D1-D4 (Wurth 150060WS75000): body polarity mark = ANODE -> pad 2; CPL angles include +180 deg.\n12. Fiducials: 6 (FID1, FID2, FID3, FID4, FID5, FID6), 3 per side. Board 106.0 x 150.0 mm."
		(at 160 70.86 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "3ac4c5b4-5bdc-4fc9-a027-2b43e8787970")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "F.Mask\nL1 F.Cu\n\nL2 In1.Cu\n\nL3 In2.Cu\n\nL4 In3.Cu\n\nL5 In4.Cu\n\nL6 B.Cu\nB.Mask"
